{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/4c0b80e01cf8fe54db511518df96d7b0.avif?t=1749272898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras_big/4c0b80e01cf8fe54db511518df96d7b0.avif?t=1749272898 width=800 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/af9607b139b2ac62b9118bd660b12a48.poster.avif?t=1749272898\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/af9607b139b2ac62b9118bd660b12a48.webm?t=1749272898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/af9607b139b2ac62b9118bd660b12a48.mp4?t=1749272898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/08b066f6f3bec49af957ade2e406dd32.avif?t=1749272898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras_big/08b066f6f3bec49af957ade2e406dd32.avif?t=1749272898 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a security guard working the night shift at a game console store inside a nearly abandoned mall. It was supposed to be a quiet night\u2014lock the doors, clean up, and organize the shelves. But as the hours passed, an eerie feeling settled in. The flickering neon lights, the old CCTV cameras, and the distant hum of the mall's ventilation system created an unsettling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>First, the lights started to flicker.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Then, the shadows moved.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Finally, you realized\u2014you're not alone.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/08b066f6f3bec49af957ade2e406dd32.avif?t=1749272898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras_big/08b066f6f3bec49af957ade2e406dd32.avif?t=1749272898 width=800 height=62 /></span>The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person psychological horror experience with exploration, interaction, and choice-based dialogue mechanics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/95b99f5bacd758c8fb2f6a48992f49ce.poster.avif?t=1749272898\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/95b99f5bacd758c8fb2f6a48992f49ce.webm?t=1749272898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/95b99f5bacd758c8fb2f6a48992f49ce.mp4?t=1749272898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/08b066f6f3bec49af957ade2e406dd32.avif?t=1749272898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras_big/08b066f6f3bec49af957ade2e406dd32.avif?t=1749272898 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 A tense and immersive atmosphere inside a dimly lit, retro-style store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Turkish dubbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Visuals with a VHS-inspired aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 A slow-burning horror experience that builds dread before unleashing terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you make it through the night?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639100?t=1749272898","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/600937fe957ca430adbaf7c640dac4e734580330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749272898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/cee2cdfdd0529f42783cfd6facb037aec3a34c52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749272898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/cee2cdfdd0529f42783cfd6facb037aec3a34c52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749272898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/4c0b80e01cf8fe54db511518df96d7b0.avif?t=1749272898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras_big/4c0b80e01cf8fe54db511518df96d7b0.avif?t=1749272898 width=800 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/af9607b139b2ac62b9118bd660b12a48.poster.avif?t=1749272898\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/af9607b139b2ac62b9118bd660b12a48.webm?t=1749272898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639100/extras/a